# Step 1: Choose a base image (use FROM image:tag)

# Step 2: Set working directory inside container (use WORKDIR /path)

# Step 3: Copy package.json and package-lock.json first (use COPY)

# Step 4: Install dependencies (use RUN npm install)

# Step 5: Copy rest of source code (use COPY . .)

# Step 6: Document the port your app listens on (use EXPOSE port)

# Step 7: Define the startup command (use CMD ["executable", "args"])
